          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 80 SW          ELLESBOROUGH             HAMPDEN BOTTOM 5/20                                       Barn immediately  W. of                                            Dirtywood Farmhouse 1.12.78 GV                                         II Barn with attached stables.  Barn is late C18, refurbished C20.  Timber frame with C20 weatherboard cladding and old tile roof.  3 bays, the centre bay with threshing floor and double doors, those to N. in gabled projection.  Curved principal trusses  with curved braces to tie beams, and shaped jowls to main posts.  Later stable range attached to west is similar but with lower C20 tiled roof, one board door and one stable door. Listing NGR: SP8481103830"
    }
  ],
